@module weapons ; The weapons: firing, the bullets, the power level
@about Fire shoots the current Weapon $A013: 0 the gun, 1 double fire (two shots, up and down), 2 laser (one long shot), 3 multiple (Rex's shot plus one from each drone), 4 spray (8 shots fanned by SprayDirections $B436). PowerLevel $A014 (1-5) sets how many shots may be in the air (FindShotSlot) and is used up by firing (PowerDrain $B9EF) and gained by power pods (PowerGain $B98E); at 1 the weapon falls back to the best one held (BestWeapon $B9D7). The power bar in the HUD shows it.
@about Rex's bullets live in 30 records of 15 bytes at $5B60, the enemies' in 20 at $5D22: [X][Y][grid pointer][flags][dX][dY][live][speed][..][type][count][..]. MoveBullets steps them by type: the gun's bullet, the long laser beam, a spray dot, an enemy shot; a bullet that meets a solid cell stops, and the cells 4, 5 and 6 are damaged (BulletHitsCell $B707).
