@module rooms ; The rooms: drawing a room, the exits, the objects made, the spawners
@about DrawRoom draws the room Room $A0B8 from RoomMaps $75E0: each block of BlockDefs $6CE0 is 3 x 3 characters; each character goes into the back buffer (CharGraphics $63E0), its attribute into the attribute shadow $E55F (CharAttrs $6BE0) and its flag into the grid $E1FF (CharFlags $62E0); the animated characters are listed in SceneryCellList $D962 with their cell index in $DE9F. ReadExits takes the room's exits and object list from RoomExits $B133; MakeObjects builds the records from the list.
@about Monsters keep coming: the random spawner (SpawnRandom $C9CA) makes one of SpawnKind $A088 from the room's spawn sides every SpawnPeriod passes; rooms 2, 3, 4, 6 and 20 also run the scripted spawn (ScriptSpawn $A9F4).
