@module rexmove ; Rex's moves: walk, jump, fall, the edges of the room
@about Rex walks 2 pixels a pass (4 with SPEED UP, SpeedUp $A072: WalkRightKey / WalkLeftKey set RexSpeed), jumps by JumpSteps $D0D8 (up 6, 6, 4, 4, 2, 2, 0, ...) and falls faster each step (FallSpeed $A0BC) until a cell that is not passable (PassCells $D09A) or a ladder. Walking off the left or right edge, jumping off the top or falling off the bottom changes the room by the exits; falling with no exit below kills him.
$CFCC c SpeedUpTick ; The SPEED UP bonus: count down; the speed back at the end
> SpeedUpPhase $A073 starts at 200 (PrizeSpeedUp) and counts the walking passes; at 0 SpeedUp ends. Run by p1-speedup: the roulette stopped on SPEED UP by fire, SpeedUpPhase 200 at frame 1740 down to 0 at 2740, RexSpeed 4 / -4 meanwhile, 2 / -2 after.
> Witness: L1 200 (p1-speedup).
